        "20db9bb4-6395-4626-98dd-2b2890ba806e": {
          "type": "html",
          "settings": {
            "width": "50%",
            "html__text": "<div class=\"content-about\"><h2>Our story</h2>\n<p>CWA is an Australian distributor of water and wastewater instrumentation and critical spares. We built our catalog for the people who actually spec and maintain treatment plants and pump stations — engineers who arrive with a product code from an operations manual, not a product name from a brochure.</p>\n<p>Every listing carries a clear CWA code, a downloadable data sheet and AUD pricing, so the right flowmeter, analyzer or sensor can be verified and ordered online without a phone call or a quote request.</p>\n<div class=\"blockquote-custom mt-4 text-left\">\n<div class=\"blockquote-custom-icon\"></div>\n<p class=\"mb-0 mt-2 font-italic\">We exist so the next replacement part is a search away, not a week-long procurement chain.</p>\n</div>\n</div>"
          }
        }
      },
